Questions for Part II: How Humans React
Chapter 7 says “the Entitled” and “the Ready” are mindsets, not kinds
of people, and most of us carry a little of both. Where do you notice
each in yourself?
The Luddites understood exactly what the machines would do to their
pay, and still lost. What would they need to have done differently?
Musicians ran newspaper ads against “the Robot” in 1930; one ad
claimed two million supporters. Is your trade running its own version
now? Would you sign the coupon?
Whatʼs one thing your household depends on that you couldnʼt replace
for a month? Who near you could help if it failed?
